          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Since callout numbers can interfere with the syntax of the code they are annotating, an AsciiDoc processor provides several features to hide the callout numbers from both the source and the converted document. The sections that follow detail these features."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_callout_syntax",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Callout syntax"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you add callout numbers to example code in a verbatim (e.g., source) block, and a reader selects that source code in the generated HTML, we don’t want the callout numbers to get caught up in the copied text. If the reader pastes that example code into a code editor and tries to run it, the extra characters that define the callout numbers will likely lead to compile or runtime errors. To mitigate this problem, and AsciiDoc processor uses a CSS rule to prevent the callouts from being selected. That way, the callout numbers won’t get copied."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "On the other side of the coin, you don’t want the callout annotations or CSS messing up your raw source code either. You can tuck your callouts neatly behind line comments. When font-based icons are enabled (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "icons=font"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "), the AsciiDoc processor will recognize the line comments characters in front of a callout number—​optionally offset by a space—​and remove them when converting the document. When font-based icons aren’t enabled, the line comment characters are not removed so that the callout numbers remain hidden by the line comment."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Here are the line comments that are supported:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": "ex-prevent",
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "----\nline of code // <1>\nline of code # <2>\nline of code ;; <3>\nline of code <!--4-->\n----\n<1> A callout behind a line comment for C-style languages.\n<2> A callout behind a line comment for Ruby, Python, Perl, etc.\n<3> A callout behind a line comment for Clojure.\n<4> A callout behind a line comment for XML or SGML languages like HTML."
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Prevent callout copy and paste"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The result of "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Example 2"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#ex-prevent"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is rendered below."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "line of code "
              },
              {
                "guard": "// ",
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO2-1",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "1",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\nline of code "
              },
              {
                "guard": "# ",
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO2-2",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "2",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\nline of code "
              },
              {
                "guard": ";; ",
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO2-3",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "3",
                "src": "",
                "xml": false
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "\nline of code "
              },
              {
                "guard": null,
                "icons": null,
                "id": "CO2-4",
                "kind": "callout",
                "number": "4",
                "src": "",
                "xml": true
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "colist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO2-1"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "A callout behind a line comment for C-style languages."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "coids": [
                  "CO2-2"
                ],
                "icons": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "A callout behind a line comment for Ruby, Python, Perl, etc."
                  }
                ],
                "src": ""
